- [S3] STC15 failed: Every variable used in a guard must be formally defined. | Guard `v1 = 'Yes'` on `b1 -> n3` uses undefined variable `v1`. | Guard `v2 = 'No'` on `b2 -> c2` uses undefined variable `v2`. | DSL: guard(b1,n3,"v1 = 'Yes'"); guard(b2,c2,"v2 = 'No'")
- [S4] STC16 failed: Every outgoing edge of XOR/OR branches must have exactly one guard. | XOR/OR edge `b1 -> c1` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b2 -> n5` has 0 guards; exactly one is required.
- [S5] STC20 failed: Every non-end node must have a path to at least one end node. | Violations: n15 | DSL: action(n15,"select new applicant from the list")

